span-4"><div class="lg:sticky lg:top-24"><p class="eyebrow animate-fade text-signal-deep">The Band</p><h1 id="band-title" class="animate-rise mt-4 font-display text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,5.4rem)] uppercase leading-[0.88] text-ink">One loop. Every signal.</h1><p class="animate-rise mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink/65" style="animation-delay:0.1s">A titanium sensor core woven into a strap you never take off. No screen, no charging anxiety, no subscription.</p><p class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><span class="font-display text-4xl text-ink">$299</span><span class="text-[13px] text-ink/55">All metrics included</span></p><fieldset class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-6"><legend class="sr-only">Colorway</legend><p aria-hidden="true" class="eyebrow text-ink/55">Colorway</p><div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Colorway" class="mt-4 space-y-2"><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="true" class="flex w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-3 text-left transition-all duration-300 border-ink bg-white shadow-[0_10px_30px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-10 shrink-0 rounded-full ring-1 ring-black/10" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1c1c1e 0%, #1c1c1e 62%, #ff5a1f 62%)"></span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink">Carbon Black</span><span class="block text-[13px] leading-snug text-ink/55">Black double-weave strap, DLC-coated titanium core and a signal-orange inner lining.</span></span></button><button type="button" role="radio" aria-checked="false" class="flex w-full items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-3 text-left transition-all duration-300 border-line hover:border-ink/35"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-10 shrink-0 rounded-full ring-1 ring-black/10" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ff5a1f 0%, #ff5a1f 62%, #2f2f33 62%)"></span><span><span class="block text-[15px] font-semibold text-ink">Signal Orange</span><span class="block text-[13px] leading-snug text-ink/