>185 to 220 mm</span></button></div></fieldset><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 rounded-full min-h-14 px-6 py-2 text-[15px] leading-snug sm:px-7 bg-ink text-white hover:bg-ink-soft mt-8 w-full justify-center" href="/pace/band#reserve">Reserve this band<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[13px] text-ink/65"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-4 shrink-0 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>No payment today, confirm before it ships</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-truck size-4 shrink-0 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"></path><path d="M15 18H9"></path><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"></path><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"></circle></svg>First deliveries February 2027</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw size-4 shrink-0 text-ink" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg>Free size exchanges within 60 days</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section id="design" aria-labelledby="design-title" class="bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="@container w-full max-w-4xl"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">01</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Design</p><h2 id="design-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Made</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">to</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">be</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">worn,</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">not</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">managed.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">Without a screen to protect, every millimetre went to comfort and signal. The result is a band you put on once and stop thinking about.</div></div><dl data-stagger="true" class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-line lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="min-w-0 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8"><dt class="sr-only">Total weight, core and strap</dt><dd><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 sm:gap-2"><span data-count="24" data-decimals="0" class="font-display text-[2.25rem] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink sm:text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)]">24</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink/50 sm:text-base">g</span></span><span class="mt-3 block text-[13px] text-ink/60 sm:text-[15px]">Total weight, core and strap</span></dd></div><div class="min-w-0 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8"><dt class="sr-only">Typical battery life</dt><dd><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 sm:gap-2"><span data-count="10" data-decimals="0" class="font-display text-[2.25rem] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink sm:text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)]">10</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink/50 sm:text-base">days</span></span><span class="mt-3 block text-[13px] text-ink/60 sm:text-[15px]">Typical battery life</span></dd></div><div class="min-w-0 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8"><dt class="sr-only">Optical, thermal, motion, pressure and GNSS</dt><dd><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 sm:gap-2"><span data-count="9" data-decimals="0" class="font-display text-[2.25rem] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink sm:text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)]">9</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink/50 sm:text-base">sensors</span></span><span class="mt-3 block text-[13px] text-ink/60 sm:text-[15px]">Optical, thermal, motion, pressure and GNSS</span></dd></div><div class="min-w-0 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8"><dt class="sr-only">Water resistance, 10 ATM</dt><dd><span class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 gap-y-1 sm:gap-2"><span data-count="100" data-decimals="0" class="font-display text-[2.25rem] leading-none tabular-nums text-ink sm:text-[clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)]">100</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink/50 sm:text-base">m</span></span><span class="mt-3 block text-[13px] text-ink/60 sm:text-[15px]">Water resistance, 10 ATM</span></dd></div></dl><div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface aspect-[4/5] rounded-[28px]"><div data-parallax="6" class="absolute -inset-y-[12%] inset-x-0"><img alt="An athlete gripping a kettlebell while wearing a black PACE Band" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" /images/pace/life-train.jpg 384w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 640w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 750w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 828w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/life-train.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/life-train.jpg"/></div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface aspect-[4/5] rounded-[28px]"><div data-parallax="6" class="absolute -inset-y-[12%] inset-x-0"><img alt="An athlete stretching after training while wearing an orange PACE Band" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw" /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 384w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 640w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 750w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 828w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/life-recover.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/life-recover.jpg"/></div></div></div></div></section><section id="materials" aria-labelledby="materials-title" class="bg-surface py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="@container w-full max-w-3xl"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">02</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Materials</p><h2 id="materials-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Every</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">surface,</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">considered.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">Four materials, each chosen for one job and finished to disappear against the skin.</div></div><ul data-stagger="true" class="mt-14 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-white"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img alt="The curved titanium core meeting the woven strap in a seamless line" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-out-expo hover:scale-[1.03]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 384w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 640w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 750w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 828w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/macro-core.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/macro-core.jpg"/></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="eyebrow text-signal-deep">01</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Titanium core</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Machined from Grade 5 titanium and bead-blasted to a satin finish. The core curves with your wrist, so it sits flat through sleep and sprints alike.</p></div></li><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-white"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img alt="Macro texture of the black twill weave with a single orange edge thread" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-out-expo hover:scale-[1.03]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 384w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 640w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 750w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 828w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/macro-weave.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/macro-weave.jpg"/></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="eyebrow text-signal-deep">02</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Double-weave strap</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Recycled nylon woven over an elastane core. It breathes in the heat, dries in about 20 minutes and keeps its shape for years.</p></div></li><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-white"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img alt="The underside sensor array with green LEDs glowing beneath sapphire glass" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-out-expo hover:scale-[1.03]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 384w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 640w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 750w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 828w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/macro-sensors.jpg"/></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="eyebrow text-signal-deep">03</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Sapphire sensor window</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">A domed sapphire lens holds the optical array against the skin with gentle, even pressure, the single biggest factor in a clean signal.</p></div></li><li class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-white"><div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden"><img alt="Close-up of the two titanium halves of the magnetic clasp" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover transition-transform duration-[1400ms] ease-out-expo hover:scale-[1.03]" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 640px) 50vw, 100vw" /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 384w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 640w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 750w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 828w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/macro-clasp.jpg"/></div><div class="p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="eyebrow text-signal-deep">04</p><h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">MagLock clasp</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-lg text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Two titanium halves close with 40 newtons of magnetic hold and a precise mechanical key. On with one hand, never off by accident.</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section id="colorways" aria-labelledby="colorways-title" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="@container w-full max-w-3xl"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">03</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Colorways</p><h2 id="colorways-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Three</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">finishes.</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">One</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">standard.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">Every colorway uses the same sensors, the same titanium and the same 24 grams. Choose the one you will want to wear every day.</div></div><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-surface mt-14 aspect-[4/3] rounded-[32px] sm:aspect-[16/8]"><div data-parallax="5" class="absolute -inset-y-[12%] inset-x-0"><img alt="PACE Band in Carbon Black, Signal Orange and Stone Titanium standing side by side" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" /images/pace/colorways.jpg 640w, /images/pace/colorways.jpg 750w, /images/pace/colorways.jpg 828w, /images/pace/colorways.jpg 1080w, /images/pace/colorways.jpg 1200w, /images/pace/colorways.jpg 1920w, /images/pace/colorways.jpg 2048w, /images/pace/colorways.jpg 3840w" src="/images/pace/colorways.jpg"/></div></div><ul data-stagger="true" class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col rounded-[28px] bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-12 rounded-full ring-1 ring-black/10" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #1c1c1e 0%, #1c1c1e 62%, #ff5a1f 62%)"></span><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Carbon Black</h3></div><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Black double-weave strap, DLC-coated titanium core and a signal-orange inner lining.</p><button type="button" class="mt-6 inline-flex h-11 w-max items-center rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ink/45">View in 3D</button></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-[28px] bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-12 rounded-full ring-1 ring-black/10" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #ff5a1f 0%, #ff5a1f 62%, #2f2f33 62%)"></span><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Signal Orange</h3></div><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">High-visibility orange weave with a graphite titanium core, made for early starts and late finishes.</p><button type="button" class="mt-6 inline-flex h-11 w-max items-center rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ink/45">View in 3D</button></li><li class="flex flex-col rounded-[28px] bg-surface p-6 sm:p-7"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><span aria-hidden="true" class="size-12 rounded-full ring-1 ring-black/10" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #c8c1b4 0%, #c8c1b4 62%, #8d8579 62%)"></span><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Stone Titanium</h3></div><p class="mt-4 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/60">Warm stone weave with a bead-blasted natural titanium core and a tonal lining.</p><button type="button" class="mt-6 inline-flex h-11 w-max items-center rounded-full border border-ink/15 bg-white px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:border-ink/45">View in 3D</button></li></ul></div></section><section id="sizing" aria-labelledby="sizing-title" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-surface py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="@container w-full"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">04</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Sizing</p><h2 id="sizing-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Find</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">your</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">fit.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">The core should sit snug, one finger above the wrist bone. Most people wear Medium.</div></div><ol data-stagger="true" class="mt-10 space-y-5"><li class="flex gap-4"><span class="inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-[13px] font-semibold text-white">1</span><p class="pt-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Wrap a strip of paper around your wrist, just above the wrist bone where the band will sit.</p></li><li class="flex gap-4"><span class="inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-[13px] font-semibold text-white">2</span><p class="pt-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Mark where the paper overlaps and measure the length in millimetres.</p></li><li class="flex gap-4"><span class="inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-ink text-[13px] font-semibold text-white">3</span><p class="pt-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Choose the size whose range puts you closest to the middle. Between sizes, go smaller.</p></li></ol></div><div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7"><div data-reveal="true" class="overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-white"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-left"><caption class="sr-only">Size guide by wrist circumference</caption><thead><tr class="border-b border-line text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink/50"><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold sm:px-6">Size</th><th scope="col" class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold sm:px-6">Wrist</th><th scope="col" class="hidden px-6 py-4 font-semibold sm:table-cell">Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=""><td class="border-b border-line px-4 py-3 sm:px-6 sm:py-5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 text-left"><span class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">S</span><span class="text-[13px] text-ink/55">Small</span></button></td><td class="border-b border-line px-4 py-3 text-[15px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink sm:px-6 sm:py-5">130 to 160 mm</td><td class="hidden border-b border-line px-6 py-5 text-[13px] text-ink/60 sm:table-cell">Most wrists under 16 cm</td></tr><tr class="bg-surface/70"><td class="border-b border-line px-4 py-3 sm:px-6 sm:py-5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true" class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 text-left"><span class="font-display text-2xl text-ink">M</span><span class="text-[13px] text-ink/55">Medium</span></button></td><td class="border-b border-line px-4 py-3 text-[15px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink sm:px-6 sm:py-5">155 to 190 mm</td><td class="hidden border-b border-line px-6 py-5 text-[13px] text-ink/60 sm:table-cell">The most common fit</td></tr><tr class=""><td class="border-b border-line px-4 py-3 sm:px-6 sm:py-5"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" class="flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 text-left"><span class