4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Clasp</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">MagLock titanium magnetic clasp, 40 N hold</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Weight</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">24 g total, 11 g core</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Colorways</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Carbon Black, Signal Orange, Stone Titanium</dd></div></dl></div><div data-reveal="true"><h3 class="eyebrow border-b border-ink pb-4 text-ink">Sensors</h3><dl><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Optical array</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">7 LEDs (4 green, 2 red, 1 infrared) and 4 photodiodes</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Sampling</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Adaptive, 25 to 256 Hz</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Skin temperature</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Digital sensor, 0.01 °C resolution</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Motion</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">6-axis inertial unit, accelerometer and gyroscope</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Altitude</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Barometric altimeter</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Positioning</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Dual-frequency GNSS, L1 + L5</dd></div></dl></div><div data-reveal="true"><h3 class="eyebrow border-b border-ink pb-4 text-ink">Metrics</h3><dl><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Heart</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Heart rate 24/7, resting heart rate, HRV (rMSSD), zones</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Sleep</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Stages, score, consistency, smart haptic alarm</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Health</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Respiratory rate, blood oxygen, skin temperature deviation</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Readiness</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Daily recovery score with contributors</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Training</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Training load, load focus, VO2 max, recovery time</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Running</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Pace, distance, elevation, cadence, stride length</dd></div></dl></div><div data-reveal="true"><h3 class="eyebrow border-b border-ink pb-4 text-ink">Power &amp; connectivity</h3><dl><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Battery</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Up to 10 days typical, 24 h continuous GNSS</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Charging</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">MagCharge slide-on puck, 0 to 80% in 35 min</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Storage</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">14 days of full-resolution data on the band</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Wireless</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">Bluetooth 5.3 Low Energy</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Water</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">10 ATM, pool and open-water swim tracking</dd></div><div class="grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] gap-4 border-b border-line py-4 text-sm break-words sm:gap-6 sm:text-[15px]"><dt class="text-ink/55">Compatibility</dt><dd class="font-medium text-ink">iOS 17 and Android 12 or later</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-surface py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="@container w-full"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">06</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>FAQ</p><h2 id="faq-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">Questions,</span></span> <span class="inline-block overflow-hidden pb-[0.1em] -mb-[0.1em] align-top"><span data-word="true" class="inline-block">answered.</span></span></h2><div data-reveal="true" class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed sm:text-[17px] text-ink/60 text-pretty">Everything about wearing, charging and trusting a band without a screen.</div></div></div><div data-reveal="true" class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6"><ul class="border-t border-line"><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-0" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-0" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Why doesn&#x27;t PACE Band have a screen?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo rotate-45 border-ink bg-ink text-white group-hover:border-ink"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-0" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Because the most useful data is the data you don&#x27;t stare at. Without a display, the band is thinner, lighter, lasts up to 10 days and never pulls your attention mid-session. Live numbers stream to your phone when you want them, and silent haptic cues tell you when you drift out of your target zone.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-1" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-1" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Is there a subscription?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-1" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">No. Every metric, every insight, your complete history and full data export are included with the band. Software updates that add new features are free for the life of the product.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-2" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-2" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">How do I start a workout without a screen?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-2" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Double-tap the core and a short haptic pulse confirms the session has started. Runs, rides, swims, walks and strength sessions are also detected automatically, and you can start any of 90 activity types from the app.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-3" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-3" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">How accurate are heart rate and HRV?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-3" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">In validation against chest-strap ECG, PACE Band measured heart rate within 1.8 bpm on average across 40 activity types and tracked overnight HRV with a 0.97 correlation. Accuracy can vary with fit, so wear the core snug, one finger above the wrist bone.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-4" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-4" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Can I swim and shower with it?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-4" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Yes. The band is rated 10 ATM and tracks pool and open-water swims, including distance, stroke rate and SWOLF. The woven strap dries in about 20 minutes.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-5" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-5" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">Does it work with the apps I already use?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-5" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Workouts and daily metrics sync to Apple Health, Health Connect, Strava and TrainingPeaks, and you can export your full history as CSV or FIT files at any time.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-6" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-6" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">What if my size is wrong?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-6" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Exchanges are free within 60 days. Measure your wrist just above the bone with a strip of paper, then pick the size whose range puts you in the middle. Between sizes, choose the smaller one.</p></div></div></li><li class="border-b border-line"><h3><button id="_R_526_-button-7" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_526_-panel-7" class="group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left sm:gap-6 sm:py-6"><span class="text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-xl">When will my band ship?</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-0.5 inline-flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line transition-all duration-500 ease-out-expo group-hover:border-ink/40"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div id="_R_526_-panel-7" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_526_-button-7" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-out-expo grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><p class="max-w-3xl pb-7 pr-4 text-[15px] sm:pr-12 leading-relaxed text-ink/65">Reservations are open now and need no payment. First deliveries begin in February 2027 in the order reservations were made, and we confirm by email before anything is charged.</p></div></div></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="reserve" aria-labelledby="reserve-title" class="scroll-mt-20 bg-white py-24 sm:py-36"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] gap-12 px-5 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="@container w-full"><p data-reveal="fade" class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-3 text-ink/55"><span class="text-signal-deep">07</span><span class="h-px w-8 bg-ink/25" aria-hidden="true"></span>Reserve</p><h2 id="reserve-title" data-split="true" class="mt-6 font-display text-[clamp(1.75rem,9cqw,5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.92] text-ink text-balance"><span class="inline-block overflow-hidde